  "reference": "1 Pet. 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1PE 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bulamu bubwakaluukhasibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khubeela Kristo aapisibwa siibi mu mubili, enywe mwesi khukhwola mube ne kamebaasio menako sikila oyo yesi oupisibwa siibi mu mubili se amenya mu bwoni lundi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama luno khucha ebweeni, khukhwola mu menye limenya lienywe lie chindaalo chimuramirekho mu sibala muno mu khwimeelelwa ne lilienya lia Wele ne kakhaba khulwe liliekoomba lie kumubili tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mwarumikhira chindaalo chiweele chingali khukhola niko bakhamanyile Wele tawe basiima khukhola. Limenya lienywe liaba khukhola bumayaanu, liliekoomba, bumeesi, sifwaabi, bipupu bie bunywi, ne liliesaaya lie bifwaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne luno bakhamanyile Wele abo tawe, bauka nga ne mukhaambananga nabo, mu limenya lie sifwaabi elio tawe, khwako bamukhomanga enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bakhaboole kakabwe koosi khu Wele, owerekekha khukhalakila balamu ne bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako niko kakakila Elomo Endayi yelwachibwa akhaba khu bafu, nio akhaba ne baaba ne bakhalakilwe mu liba liabwe lie kumubili, boole khumenya mu roho nga Wele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi balayi be biianwa bia Wele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisiakamo sie bibiindu bioosi sili embi. Khukhwola mube ne lilieliinda lundi ne bukesi, nio munyale khusaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chis. 10.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khutuuma bibiindu bioosi, siimana mwabeene ne mwabeene ne busiime bukhawa tawe, sikila busiime bufunikhanga bubwoni bukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekhoyela babasienywe mu chingo chenywe, ne mukhelung'unyakho tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli sia mulala nga omwimeelesi omulayi owe biianwa bia Wele lukano na lukano, khukhwola abirumikhire khulwe bulayi bwe babasie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi owilwacha khukhwola elwache nga burume bwa Wele; yesi yesi okholanga kia Wele khukhwola akhole ne kamaani niko Wele amuelesianga, nio mu biindu bioosi efuma yoole khuaanwa khu Wele khubirira mu Yesu Kristo oli ne luyali ne bunyali mindali na mindali. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khuchuunisibwa nga omukristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaale base basiime, mukhesindukhila kamakhako kamarafu niko mulikho muchuunisibwamo, nga kali sisiindu sikeni silamwikholekhangakho tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali ba ne busangaafu nga mulikho musaanga mu khuchuunisibwa khwa Kristo, nio mwole khuuba ne khoyo engali nga luyali lwewe lulibonekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli ne chikhabi mwaba ne mukhomwa sikila muli babeeka ba Kristo; sikila liekesia lili Roho owa Wele owe luyali, amulimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaaba bali yesi yesi khwinywe aukuumwa, likhaba bali sikila ali omwiiri namwe omwifwi namwe omundu omubi namwe owekhupa mu makhuwa ke babaandu babaandi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaaba bali oukuumwa sikila oli Omukristo, likhakhuambia chisoni tawe, ne kakhali elesia Wele luyali mu lisina elio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise siolile sie likhalaka khurakikha, mala babaandu ba Wele bakhabe be khunyoa khukhalakilwa. Ne liaba bali likharakikhire khwifwe, aba kakhabe kariena khwaabo bakhasuubila Elomo Endayi khukhwama khu Wele tawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chis. 11.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga liiandiko liboolanga lili, “Kaaba bali buli butinyu khu baandu balayi khuonisibwa; aba siina nono, sikhekholekhe khu booni bakhasuubila Wele tawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, abo bachuunisibwa sikila lili lilienya lia Wele khu nibo, bakhoyeele khulwe bikholwa biabwe bilayi basuubile elala babeene mu mubuumbi wabwe, oliindanga lisuubisia liewe buli lwoosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
